Z||000001||Voytek||09-21-2001||04:53 PM||||Ouch!<P>Girls are weird.<BR>Allow me to translate:<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Female: I just really liek you alot<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Translation: I don't like you enough.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Female: cause I have a problem with flirting<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Translation: I have a problem with screwing around.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Female: I am just not sure if I want one yet.... cause I mean.. I dunno<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Translation: I will never want one as long as I'm able to screw around.<P>Sorry buddy.  I know this sounds mean but that's the kind of girl I wouldn't touch with a 10 foot pole if I were looking for a relationship.  That's the kind of girl I'd look for if I wanted a good time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> .<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||btoth||09-21-2001||07:22 PM||||Woah... this sounds <I>waaaaaayyyy</I> to familiar.  <P>It's hard to tell just by what someone says, you'd have to know them as a person to judge, which I don't.  <P>You might not like it, but if you managed to make it through that conversation alive... you might try asking her to tell you if she's just not interested, or if she's interested in someone else more.  There's always the chance that she <I>is</I> telling the truth and just isn't ready for a "title".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I could go on and on about my similar situation, but it would take pages and pages to appreciate the full story.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
