Z||000009||LZeitgeist||09-21-2001||11:21 PM||||Women want whatever it is that they don't have at the moment, and they will stave off committing to the acquisition of any one particular thing right up to the point where they are right on the very edge of losing the opportunity to gain said thing, in which case they will choose to acquire it and then they will *still* not be satisfied by said thing.<P>Give up trying to make sense of it. Nail her if she'll let you, and then find someone else. As soon as you find someone else, she will not be able to live without you. If you think she's worth keeping, at that point, it will at least be up to your whim instead of hers whether or not you two enter a long-term relationship.<P>(Why yes, I *have* had a couple of beers... that is why my "blatant honesty" circuit is louder than usual.)||||reg||1
